===description===
A union keeps at most 128 string literals; the next one widens it to `string`.
Past the first few shapes the appends fold into one `array{'m': ...}`, whose
literal union crosses the cap. Without it, each append rescanned every literal
collected so far, so a long run of literal-valued appends (a PHPStan baseline)
went cubic.
===file===
